I made some experiments with Sam in wizard mode. Invulnerability alone
is not sufficient against him, because Thiefbane will still level-drain
you. So you either have to wield Excalibur (in addition to having a
protection against beheading) or to wear an amulet of drain resistance.
Moreover, you will not hit him unless you are about level 26 or better
yourself.

As an artifact for your own use, Thiefbane is not worth the effort by
the way (unless you have intrinsic drain resistance like a necromancer),
because every once in a while it will try to drain a level from you
instead of your opponent (I guess each time the monster is drain resistant).


